-> Particle type + handler as two statements (the combined `ClassName{...}
-> => {}` sugar was removed alongside `type` — see T30).

Log = Particle ∩ { _class ∈ "Log", message ∈ String, level ∈ String }
Ack = Particle ∩ { _class ∈ "Ack", ok ∈ Number }

Log => {
    assert message = "hello"
    assert level = "info"
    return Ack{ ok = 1 }
}

emit Log{message = "hello", level = "info"} to this get result
assert result.ok = 1
